BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 416.10 Tm (Morales's show that these families tour three to five different properties and that agencies don't really see you until a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 400.87 Tm (client has actually stayed at your house [5tg19JIMU0o @ 00:20:22]. Fees are where shortlisted homes quietly lose.) Tj ET
