BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 461.77 Tm (The first money trap is invisible books. Jesse Vasquez admits all early cash went into one place and profitability was) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 446.55 Tm (unknown, relays CPA Amanda Han's warning that commingled funds get traced back to personal accounts in a lawsuit,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 431.32 Tm (and says the business operated blind on bookkeeping for five to six years before Baselane sub-accounts fixed it) Tj ET
