BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 294.30 Tm (Calendar mistakes kill visibility. Shona warns that a calendar peppered with random weekend bookings will not show) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 279.07 Tm (up in search results, which is why the play is a duplicate listing with an open calendar [pWVHjrvUQkc @ 00:22:25].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 263.85 Tm (Ruben Kanya opens the STR window no more than 30 days out and refuses Fourth of July bookings in May, and Katie) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 248.62 Tm (Lion adds that if you don't pick which strategy goes on top, STR wins by default [vbHlGVZKjvg @ 00:37:26]. Timing) Tj ET
