BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 372.00 Tm (Section 4: Firsthand Failure Modes, Traps & Economics Checks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 349.77 Tm (The first trap is the wrong guest. Dr Chau Ong's vacation-rental partiers trashed the place, which he calls a nightmare) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 334.55 Tm (and the reason he now targets corporate travelers, medical professionals and insurance clients [JWjjZOTJhUs @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 319.32 Tm (00:01:38]. In a separate breakdown he says he never had one eviction from corporate guests in six years but did evict a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.10 Tm (vacationer, while elsewhere he cites ten years and seven to eight years with zero evictions, so the record is strong but) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 288.87 Tm (the tenure figure moves [v4LiJvYw8rc @ 00:02:34]. Sheree Hill shows that a corporate label does not screen anyone) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 273.65 Tm (by itself: she verifies the employer, runs background checks for evictions and fraud, notes that Atlanta is number one in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 258.42 Tm (the fraud, and caught a scammer using different names with five eviction cases on file [nZd4KYLOZDw @ 00:19:04].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 243.20 Tm (Jesse Vasquez adds the squatter angle. Companies book through Airbnb for the million-dollar coverage, but if a guest) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 227.97 Tm (squats, Airbnb is not going to go there to kick them out, so he still pushes for a lease signed by the company or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 212.75 Tm (occupant to get local legal protection [ypZmx1qTnpY @ 00:00:13]. Payment rails matter too: he screens and collects) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 197.52 Tm (through Turbo Tenant and says flatly not to use Zelle.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 182.30 Tm (Vacancy is where arbitrage capital dies. Jorge Garcia's lease-first unit sat empty while he waited for demand he had not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 167.07 Tm (yet built, the experience behind his backwards model [Ewazlh6zOLM @ 00:01:05]. Angela Healy warns that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 151.85 Tm (competitors who sublet apartments collapse in downturns, which is exactly why Avenue West uses management) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 136.62 Tm (agreements where owner and operator share vacancy rather than one side carrying fixed rent [f2vS4cnBnoI @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 121.40 Tm (00:20:48]. Tim Touchette lived the stress test. During COVID a friend's ten-unit nightly building in Dupont Circle hit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 106.17 Tm (100% vacancy, while his own corporate book was down about 7 and 1/2% [ZJwE-gL3Y20 @ 00:45:01]. The slower) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 90.95 Tm (bleed is contract length. Companies now cap commitments at three months, and that shift cost him condo buildings that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 75.72 Tm (imposed six-month minimums, so any building rule longer than your client's commitment window is dead inventory) Tj ET
