BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm ([ZJwE-gL3Y20 @ 00:50:10]. The economics check is simple: if your structure forces you to pay rent on a dark unit,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (your downside is the entire lease, not a soft month, and the only two hedges these operators report are shared-vacancy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (owner agreements and demand secured before the keys.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (The last set of traps is operational speed and cash recovery. Sheree Hill says a broken oven cannot wait three to four) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (days for a corporate guest, home warranties don't move fast, and the fix is a repair retainer the owner keeps on file) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm ([nZd4KYLOZDw @ 00:24:05]. The Roadmap Lodging breakdown names the product misses that cost corporate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (bookings: spotty internet is a work stoppage for an engineer or consultant, accent walls and Instagrammable decor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (might even hurt you, and a kitchen table instead of a desk with an ergonomic chair fails a 90-day stay that HR) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (managers will notice [iQn0PMSPJ5Q @ 00:05:39]. On capital, Dr Chau Ong's startup math runs $2,500 rent, a $2,500) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (deposit and $7,000 of furniture for $12,000 out of pocket, recouped in six months at $2,000 a month, with furnishing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (capped at $7,000 to $9,000 [yo5DDACarw0 @ 00:25:58]. Jesse Vasquez funds through a 0% or 3 to 5% first-year) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (credit card or an SBA loan and wants furniture paid off inside six to twelve months [ypZmx1qTnpY @ 00:06:24].) Tj ET
