BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Rafa Loza frames the logic as channel versus business: Airbnb is one channel alongside VRBO, Booking.com,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (Furnishfinder and Expedia, and the operator is the business, "You run a restaurant that happens to be listed on Yelp") Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm ([894g1JF-IuM @ 00:12:37].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (Once the vocabulary is fixed, the operators agree the pitch lives or dies on two landlord fears. 360 BNB Solutions boils) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (it down bluntly: "most landlords care about two things keeping my property in great condition and are you going to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (make the payments on time," and answers both with professional cleaning one to two times a week, all maintenance) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (handled, a "for sale" condition a long-term tenant never delivers, and payment by direct deposit with no eviction risk) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm ([prqw1liLbCM @ 00:04:16]. Jorge Contreras attacks the payment fear mechanically: fixed advertised rent that never) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (fluctuates, autopay set "two days early," and 100% written responsibility for guest-caused damage while the owner) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (keeps age-related wear like a 10-year-old AC [d8qhoiAWdLs @ 00:01:43]. Aurelio Licata reframes the whole) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (conversation in lesson eleven: "you're not offering rent, you're offering relief," meaning consistent rent, no property) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (manager to hire, multi-year leases and monthly professional cleaning set against the landlord's vacancy and turnover) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (pain [Q3hSpjquUTE @ 00:10:14]. Lara Stewart, a 28-year RN running three Houston units, strips it even simpler:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm ("you're asking to pay them rent every month is what you're asking to do" [mOvanxNbxWw @ 00:11:19]. Licata's line) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (covers the nerves: "landlords aren't grading your resume.") Tj ET
