BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (you sign it personally you are now the tenant that they expect," while warning that big REITs may still demand) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm ("company name slash your name" and a personal guarantee; a Dun & Bradstreet DUNS number builds the business) Tj ET
