BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 314.65 Tm (flow with wealth. Colin Wright names the scaling version of the same trap as the biggest mistake: expanding before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 299.42 Tm (one property works, because a deal losing $1,000 a month copied 10 times loses $10,000 a month; one operator, Drew,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 284.20 Tm (turned a property profitable only by fixing pricing and getting the landlord to lower the rent [iwB0c3u7Gpo @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 268.97 Tm (00:09:53]. LoCasa frames the fix as discipline: the common mistake is wanting five units within a month, and if unit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 253.75 Tm (number one is not profitable, adding more units does not solve the problem, so the first unit becomes a laboratory for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 238.52 Tm (pricing, cleaning, guest messaging, maintenance and actual versus projected expenses [OSi_ARPIpaM @ 00:00:42].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 223.30 Tm (Reserves stay in the bank rather than every dollar getting reinvested.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 208.07 Tm (Signed-in-principle deals still collapse after the handshake. Richie Matthews had a first-day yes turn into a no because) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 192.85 Tm (the landlord wanted to screen guests, and acquisitions in Matthews's program average six to eight weeks to close even) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 177.62 Tm (with 15 to 30 minutes a day of calling every landlord on Zillow [fH0oThfTwlg @ 00:02:22]. The rent itself can become) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 162.40 Tm (the trap. Adam, running 30 to 40% margins on a buy-low, rent-high model, watched one landlord spot $3,000 to $4,000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 147.17 Tm (a month on Zillow against a $1,000 rent, which forced a renegotiation [AxwgX6EuFNc @ 00:35:03]; Adam's guest) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 131.95 Tm (Mike Brown separately exited one lease over poor building management. Linda Kim protects the spread by walking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 116.72 Tm (away: when a landlord wanted $4,000 against the $3,700 Kim's numbers needed, Kim left, and the landlord came back) Tj ET
