BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (middle: run STR at peak and MTR in shoulder seasons, because short-term calendars can flood with bookings and then) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (crash with seasonality, and nobody has to pick one model forever [rIPWQCsi2z8 @ 00:09:08]. The real fork is) Tj ET
