BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (search it, and openly doubts CHBO after one booking there in roughly three years, telling viewers to take it with a grain) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (of salt [VtuboLMzJj0 @ 00:21:33]. The Clint Coons interview reads CHBO the opposite way, arguing a single booking) Tj ET
