BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 383.32 Tm (free rent, and set up collaboration and NoiseAware after copycat operators moved in [L48GgPbkHHU @ 00:35:17].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 368.10 Tm (Ludarell lost leases when complexes sold and the new owners declined to renew. Norman warns against thin deals such) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 352.87 Tm (as $2,000 rent for a one-bed. Jenna reports Denver landlords raising rent once they learn the model, a pattern Kenya hit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 337.65 Tm (when a landlord who bought five more properties tried to raise rent [L48GgPbkHHU @ 01:48:02]. Allen Duan's only) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 322.42 Tm (landlord problem across 25 to 30-plus deals came the same way, from a sale to a new owner. For Duan, payback math) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 307.20 Tm (is the early alarm: six months is the benchmark, and a 12-month payback means the estimates were badly off) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 291.97 Tm ([aDxy2Ei3pfQ @ 00:06:57]. BNB Fastlane adds that risk amplifies at 5-10-plus units, and that burned owners and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 276.75 Tm (cold-call lead generation grind the pipeline. Their reminder is blunt: 'you can't rent an empty house,' so lease) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 261.52 Tm (obligations and furnishing costs land before the first booking [SGmMixWY7CA @ 00:04:43].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 246.30 Tm (Midterm operations break in different places than hosts expect. Thanks for Visiting reports turnovers that take days of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 231.07 Tm (deep cleaning, reordering, and full inventory. Guests leave behind plants, mattress toppers, and patio furniture, and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 215.85 Tm (team tells hosts never to attempt a one-day turnover [wVmj30HlGcQ @ 00:07:21]. The same operators admit their own) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 200.62 Tm (MTR test lost money year over year: 'you don't know unless you test' [JtRa4_SzshI @ 00:21:50]. They also flag a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 185.40 Tm (member whose tenants are all leaving early. With about four guests a year, steady reviews are hard to build. Tim) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 170.17 Tm (Hubbard names the top remote-hosting failure bluntly as not having backups, and recommends an 'ammo box' of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 154.95 Tm (supplies, an idea credited to Jasper Rivers [n77MirHjIVo @ 00:37:13]. NickProRealty puts the tenant risk in one line:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 139.72 Tm ('In midterm, one bad tenant can cost you months.' That is why Nick's screening covers income, background, lease, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 124.50 Tm (ID. Myka Artis shows the platform side cutting both ways. Thanksgiving booked at triple the rates, yet about $7,000) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 109.27 Tm (went out under the cancellation policy. Artis also recounts a run of Furnished Finder leads where the 'last eight' traced) Tj ET
