BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 413.77 Tm (Most firsthand losses start before the lease is signed. The Scrub Society panel catalogs fake ads, spoof ads priced 30 to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 398.55 Tm (35% under market, and identity theft. They list the red flags: the 'landlord' is never in town, over-proves legitimacy,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 383.32 Tm (writes with bad or British spelling, pushes for money, and quotes rent below market [LU1LbFSyqfI @ 00:43:05]. Their) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 368.10 Tm (counter is to book a hotel for one to two weeks and get boots on the ground before sending anything. How Master,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 352.87 Tm (renting as a travel nurse, flags the structural gap. There is no in-platform payment, which means less accountability.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 337.65 Tm (Some hosts take days to reply or never do, and photos and pricing can be outdated [NHwhu1sMUfo @ 00:01:05]. On) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 322.42 Tm (the host side, speed is the failure point. The CoLiving Insider warns that 'a nurse who does not hear back the same day) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 307.20 Tm (books somewhere else' [VbsbBFnJvik @ 00:05:24]. Brian Payne adds that Furnished Finder ranking runs on usage, so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 291.97 Tm (stale availability buries a listing. Landlord Diaries turns the speed test on the applicant. Verify that the hospital contract) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 276.75 Tm (is actually secured, because a one-to-two-day reply delay from a prospect signals someone still undecided who will) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 261.52 Tm (clog your queue [XTn3a_-I1Rg @ 00:17:32].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 246.30 Tm (The expensive mistakes are lease mercy, bad underwriting, and platform dependence. Caytlyn Cole Tolliver let a tenant) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 231.07 Tm (out of the lease in October, and it cost four months of rent. Their fix was to collect first and last month's rent from then) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 215.85 Tm (on [ObdxpkrC-yE @ 00:14:21]. Caytlyn also learned that a standard homeowners policy is wrong for a rental. They) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 200.62 Tm (switched to a landlord or DP3 dwelling policy and paid about $200 to $300 a year more once coverage matched current) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 185.40 Tm (rebuild costs. The CoLiving Insider prices turnover at about $100 to $150 per room and insists on underwriting at 75%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 170.17 Tm (occupancy, not 100%, because 13-week stays churn constantly [VbsbBFnJvik @ 00:05:42]. Mark Reed's origin story is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 154.95 Tm (a double warning. First, Airbnb unilaterally cancelled everything during COVID, which forced the move to Furnished) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 139.72 Tm (Finder [utDX2blYFMk @ 00:03:20]. Second, Mark bought four auction homes at about $113,000 near Johns Hopkins) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 124.50 Tm (that claimed $500 monthly leases. The leases were false and the homes were uninhabitable [utDX2blYFMk @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 109.27 Tm (00:06:42]. Mark turned that block into 13 of 17 homes on East Chase running 95 to 97% occupancy. That came only) Tj ET
