BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 445.77 Tm (Section 4: Firsthand Failure Modes, Traps & Economics Checks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 423.55 Tm (The most repeated failure is the silent one: the owner moves out, a tenant moves in, and the homeowner policy never) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 408.32 Tm (changes. Real Property Management Palisade says this costs New Jersey owners five and six figures, and the failure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 393.10 Tm (mode is not a higher premium but a denied claim, because the carrier's first question after a fire, burst pipe, or liability) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 377.87 Tm (suit is who was living in the home [aUKpl6xobwU @ 00:00:20]. The Phoenix Insurance says they cannot count how) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 362.65 Tm (many owners have rented for years on the homeowner policy bought at closing, which violates contract language that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 347.42 Tm (pays losses only when the primary title owner occupies the home [S15pjuTJ618 @ 00:01:02]. BiggerPockets warns that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 332.20 Tm (an injured tenant on the wrong policy can leave the owner on the hook for hundreds of thousands of dollars) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 316.97 Tm ([bfsA8QKK2ZU @ 00:03:40]. Hannigan Insurance Agency, drawing on 17 years in the business, says people who try) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 301.75 Tm (to fool the insurance company always get bitten, and the fix is to cancel the home policy and write a fresh landlord) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 286.52 Tm (policy when a tenant moves in [aGvo7Dq3gTM @ 00:02:46]. The Phoenix Insurance applies the same logic to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 271.30 Tm (short-term rentals: buy the cheaper long-term form while running Airbnb and you stand a chance of getting no money) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 256.07 Tm (on the claim [S15pjuTJ618 @ 00:03:56].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 240.85 Tm (Co-living operators face the harshest version of the misrepresentation trap. The CoLiving Insider walks through Lopez) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 225.62 Tm (versus Allstate: the owner applied describing a one-family home of 1,600 square feet, but the house had six rented units) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 210.40 Tm (with lockable doors and shared bathrooms in roughly 3,000 square feet. After a loss estimated near 371,000 dollars,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 195.17 Tm (Allstate rescinded the policy back to the beginning and refunded the premiums; the owner went to court and lost, then) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 179.95 Tm (appealed and lost again [RyLyOzBiWEs @ 00:02:42]. The same channel reports a national sober living network) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 164.72 Tm (tracing many claim denials to paperwork listing homes as single-family rentals, and flags fine print on a new) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 149.50 Tm (rent-by-the-room product: a 25,000 dollar deductible for resident damage in shared spaces, theft excluded on the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 134.27 Tm (broadest form, and dog bites excluded [RyLyOzBiWEs @ 00:07:42]. Blue Fox Properties documents a denial vector) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 119.05 Tm (that has nothing to do with the policy form: missing smoke alarms are one of the fastest ways to get a claim denied,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 103.82 Tm (dual cylinder deadbolts can sink liability claims when tenants cannot exit, and missing screens can be cited as a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 88.60 Tm (contributing factor in liability claims [7sscnFcWkp4 @ 00:04:30]. Real Property Management Palisade adds that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 73.37 Tm (vacancy provisions between tenants can hold surprises [aUKpl6xobwU @ 00:01:49].) Tj ET
