BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (On commercial and lessor's risk buildings, the traps are underwriting math. CID Insurance underwriter Michelle Belden) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (checks building limit divided by square footage, normally seeing 100 to 250 dollars, and treats a figure like 33 dollars) Tj ET
